{"id":"n66580-2-4","stage":0,"title":"이상 · 以上","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66580-2-4-1","ko":"이상으로 제 발표를 마칩니다.","zh":"以上就是我的汇报内容，到此结束。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이상으로","meaning":"以上","explanation":"이상：以上；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발표를","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마칩니다.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"以上","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"顺序或位置比一般基准靠前或靠上。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"发表，发布","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"向世人公开并传播某种事实、结果或作品等。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e079fae3086b1e8a5d12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66580-2-4-2","ko":"저기, 발표에 질문이 있는데요.","zh":"那个，我对您的汇报有个问题想问。","note":"